  "scope": "Pinned Blender5.3 macOS arm64 CPU compositor static QuaternionToRotation/RotationToQuaternion normalization/component-copy islands. Typed literal/value/group/reroute/mute and qualified static Float selectors only. All source Float words must be normal or positive zero. Private Geometry Nodes CPU-MF carrier never evaluates user trees. ROTATION remains opaque in Python; terminal Float outputs use existing value runtime. No shader/EEVEE/GPU-authored, dynamic field, recombined components, fields, implicit casts or unlinked ROTATION-default equivalence.",
  "numericContract": {
